@startuml Sequence — UC-{{ NNN }} {{ Title }}
actor User
participant Controller as Ctrl
participant UseCase as UC
participant Entity as Ent
participant Repo as Repo
database DB

User -> Ctrl : POST /users {dto}
Ctrl -> UC : execute(dto)
UC -> Ent : create(data)
Ent -> Ent : validate rules (Strategy)
Ent --> UC : User created
UC -> Repo : save(user)
Repo -> DB : INSERT
DB --> Repo : ok
Repo --> UC : ok
UC --> Ctrl : UserDTO
Ctrl --> User : 201 Created

note over UC, Ent : Clean 4 layers: Controller(Frameworks) → UseCase → Entity
@enduml
